Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Polynomial Discriminant Demo", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.004002590342288*^9, 
  4.004002602701402*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cc2f4193-662e-4aa8-accf-\
0cc1ebd5b77c"],

Cell["\<\
The discriminant of a polynomial tells us when it has repeated roots.  You \
have seen the discriminant for a quadratic.  Some of you had seen the \
discriminant of a cubic.  For quadratics, cubics, and quartics the \
discriminant can help us tell where eigenvalues are real, complex etc.   \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0040026091036406`*^9, 
  4.0040027427156296`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"291dc4a5-a790-448a-9e5e-\
7b0c6e33d9fa"],

